*%% This program is free software under the terms of the GNU General
*%% Public License, version 3 or any later version; see the file
*%% LICENSE.  There is NO WARRANTY, to the extent permitted by law.
*%%
*%% The imageable areas below are not arbitrary.  They are the imaging
*%% windows Canon's own driver asks the engine for, expressed in points,
*%% and shrunk by the one column / two rows that the CUPS raster
*%% interpreter adds, so that the RIP hands the filter exactly the
*%% 592x6776 (A4) raster the printer expects.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "CNLBP600.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Canon"
*Product: "(Canon LBP6000)"
*Product: "(Canon LBP6018)"
*ModelName: "Canon LBP6000"
*ShortNickName: "Canon LBP6000 capt6000"
*NickName: "Canon LBP6000/LBP6018, capt6000 1.0"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "18"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 6000
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 50 rastertolbp6000"

*OpenGroup: General/General

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsBitsPerPixel 1/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsRowCount 160/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.2 841.68]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/US Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.52 595.2]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5 (JIS): "<</PageSize[515.76 728.4]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Env10/Envelope #10: "<</PageSize[297.36 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[311.76 623.52]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC5/Envelope C5: "<</PageSize[459.12 648.96]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "<</PageSize[279.36 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.2 841.68]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/US Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.52 595.2]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5 (JIS): "<</PageSize[515.76 728.4]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Env10/Envelope #10: "<</PageSize[297.36 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[311.76 623.52]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvC5/Envelope C5: "<</PageSize[459.12 648.96]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "<</PageSize[279.36 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "14.4 14.4 582.6 827.28"
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "14.4 14.4 597.96 777.6"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "14.4 14.4 597.96 993.6"
*ImageableArea Executive/US Executive: "14.4 14.4 509.64 741.6"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "14.4 14.4 405.96 580.8"
*ImageableArea B5/B5 (JIS): "14.4 14.4 501.96 714"
*ImageableArea Env10/Envelope #10: "28.32 28.56 270.12 655.68"
*ImageableArea EnvDL/Envelope DL: "28.32 28.56 285.48 595.2"
*ImageableArea EnvC5/Envelope C5: "28.32 28.56 431.4 620.64"
*ImageableArea EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "28.32 28.56 250.92 511.68"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.2 841.68"
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive/US Executive: "522 756"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "419.52 595.2"
*PaperDimension B5/B5 (JIS): "515.76 728.4"
*PaperDimension Env10/Envelope #10: "297.36 684"
*PaperDimension EnvDL/Envelope DL: "311.76 623.52"
*PaperDimension EnvC5/Envelope C5: "459.12 648.96"
*PaperDimension EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "279.36 540"

*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Plain
*MediaType Plain/Plain Paper: "<</MediaType(Plain)/cupsMediaType 1>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType PlainL/Plain Paper L: "<</MediaType(PlainL)/cupsMediaType 8>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Heavy/Heavy Paper: "<</MediaType(Heavy)/cupsMediaType 4>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType HeavyH/Heavy Paper H: "<</MediaType(HeavyH)/cupsMediaType 5>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Transparency/Transparency: "<</MediaType(Transparency)/cupsMediaType 36>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Envelope/Envelope: "<</MediaType(Envelope)/cupsMediaType 32>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*CloseGroup: General

*OpenGroup: PrintQuality/Print Quality

*OpenUI *CaptDarkness/Toner Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *CaptDarkness
*DefaultCaptDarkness: 7
*CaptDarkness 0/0: "<</cupsInteger1 0>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 1/1: "<</cupsInteger1 1>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 2/2: "<</cupsInteger1 2>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 3/3: "<</cupsInteger1 3>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 4/4: "<</cupsInteger1 4>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 5/5: "<</cupsInteger1 5>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 6/6: "<</cupsInteger1 6>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 7/7: "<</cupsInteger1 7>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 8/8: "<</cupsInteger1 8>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 9/9: "<</cupsInteger1 9>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 10/10: "<</cupsInteger1 10>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 11/11: "<</cupsInteger1 11>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 12/12: "<</cupsInteger1 12>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 13/13: "<</cupsInteger1 13>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 14/14: "<</cupsInteger1 14>>setpagedevice"
*CaptDarkness 15/15: "<</cupsInteger1 15>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *CaptDarkness

*OpenUI *CaptTonerSave/Toner Save: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *CaptTonerSave
*DefaultCaptTonerSave: False
*CaptTonerSave False/Off: "<</cupsInteger0 0>>setpagedevice"
*CaptTonerSave True/On: "<</cupsInteger0 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *CaptTonerSave

*CloseGroup: PrintQuality

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Bold: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-BoldOblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Oblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Bold: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-BoldOblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica-Oblique: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Symbol: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Bold: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-BoldItalic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Italic: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM

*%% End of Canon-LBP6000.ppd
